# Environment files
# .env, .env.development and .env.production are managed by the platform and
# contain ONLY publishable client values (Stripe pk_*, Supabase publishable
# key, project id). Server secrets — Stripe gateway keys, webhook signing
# secrets, the Supabase service-role key, LOVABLE_API_KEY — are injected at
# runtime and must never be written to a file in this repo.
.env*.local
.env.local
.dev.vars.local
*.pem
*.key
